spec/spec-process-agent-context-operations-documentation.md:18:The purpose is to make accepted context behavior clear to operators, implementers, and future AI agents working in the Product Repository.
spec/spec-process-agent-context-operations-documentation.md:31:- **Runtime Settings**: `.symphony/settings.json` configuration.
spec/spec-process-agent-context-operations-documentation.md:38:- **REQ-002**: Documentation MUST include secret-free Runtime Settings examples.
spec/spec-process-agent-context-operations-documentation.md:74:- **AC-002**: Given a Runtime Settings example is copied, When reviewed for secrets, Then it contains no token values or local `.env` contents.
spec/spec-process-agent-context-operations-documentation.md:97:- **DAT-002**: Implemented Runtime Settings and Runtime State schema.
