spec/spec-process-runtime-documentation-alignment.md:70:Documentation that describes Product Repository development MUST use these commands exactly unless the command behavior changes:
spec/spec-process-runtime-documentation-alignment.md:100:- **AC-001**: Given a new user reading `README.md`, When they follow the documented path, Then they can distinguish Product Repository development from Workspace Repository operation.
